  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When hash URI fragments are created, they have a bunch of server-managed triples automatically attached to them.  But hash URI fragments are intended to be lightweight portions of a resource, and the server-managed predicates aren't useful in that context.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
