     "body": "<p>This is a big performance concern for our application. We have one resource with 6070 statements which takes a long time to query against.  Many of these statements could be omitted from the graph when this ticket is closed:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>pp t.list_source.resource.statements.group_by { |s| s.predicate }.map { |k, v| \"#{v.size} #{k}\" }; nil\r\n[\"2362 http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type\",\r\n \"337 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#lastModifiedBy\",\r\n \"337 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy\",\r\n \"337 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#primaryType\",\r\n \"337 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#created\",\r\n \"338 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#mixinTypes\",\r\n \"337 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#lastModified\",\r\n \"1 http://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/first\",\r\n \"1 http://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/last\",\r\n \"1 info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#hasModel\",\r\n \"336 http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart\",\r\n \"1 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#writable\",\r\n \"1 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#hasParent\",\r\n \"1 http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#exportsAs\",\r\n \"336 http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyFor\",\r\n \"335 http://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/next\",\r\n \"336 http://www.openarchives.org/ore/terms/proxyIn\",\r\n \"335 http://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/prev\",\r\n \"1 http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format\"]\r\n=&gt; nil\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
